Summary of changes relative to karoo-headwind (commit c9be073):

- Renamed so it installs alongside upstream Headwind: application id
  io.github.kf6999.truewind, Karoo extension id "truewind", app label
  "TrueWind", AIDL service action io.github.kf6999.truewind.HEADWIND_SERVICE.
  Data type ids (typeId) are unchanged.
- Update manifest, generateManifest task and CI release URLs point at
  https://github.com/kf6999/karoo-truewind/releases.
- New pure-Kotlin "core" module (angle/vector math, WindVector, WindState,
  interpolation helpers, provider interfaces); angle and lerp helpers moved
  there from DataStore.kt and util/AngleDifference.kt.
- Single shared pipeline (SensorHub, WindRepository) replacing per-data-type
  GPS, settings and DataStore flows; streams emit only on change; per-fix and
  per-emit debug logging limited to debug builds.
- Design documents in docs/SPEC.md and docs/TESTING.md describe further
  planned accuracy work (multi-model forecasts, observation anchoring,
  rider-height wind, heading fusion, virtual wind sensor).

